@startuml lld-us19-sequence
title LLD-US19 Pay an electricity bill: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant PaymentService
participant BbpsClient
Browser -> PaymentService : GET /bills?no=123456789
PaymentService -> BbpsClient : fetch()
Browser -> PaymentService : POST /bills/pay
PaymentService -> BbpsClient : pay()
PaymentService --> Browser : receipt
@enduml